<section id="<%= skinsSectionId %>" class="skin-release" aria-labelledby="<%= skinsSectionId %>-title">
  <div class="skin-release-inner">
    <div class="skin-release-heading">
      <div><p class="skin-release-kicker">Just released · Windows 0.1.3</p><h2 id="<%= skinsSectionId %>-title">Six new skins.<br>One familiar workflow.</h2></div>
      <p>Find the look that fits your studio. Midnight, Neon, Electric, Blueprint, Royal, and Walnut join the collection, with the same song, contributor, and signature workflow you already know.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="skin-release-gallery">
      <a href="/plugin-skins-collection.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View all six new plugin skins at full size"><img src="/plugin-skins-collection.png" width="1800" height="1020" alt="Actual Split Sheet Studio plugin screens in Midnight, Neon, Electric, Blueprint, Royal, and Walnut skins" loading="lazy"></a>
      <figcaption>Your studio. Your look. Switch skins in the plugin’s selector; your choice is saved with your plugin state.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="skin-release-actions"><a class="skin-release-download" href="https://app.splitsheetstudio.com/downloads/plugin/latest">Download the Windows beta <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Included with Creator and Studio. VST3 plugin and standalone app.<br>Digitally signed by Blak Marigold Pro LLC.</p></div>
    <p class="skin-release-existing">Also includes Bronze, Paper Thin, Denim, Soft, Speakeasy, and Plush.</p>
  </div>
</section>
